{%- comment -%}
  Every shopper-facing string viewer-3d.js uses, as one JSON object in the
  storefront's language: the theme's translation of each viewer_3d.ui.* key,
  including any the merchant has overridden. Rendered into data-i18n on the
  viewer element by both blocks. Keep the keys in step with DEFAULT_STRINGS in
  assets/viewer-3d.js — npm run check-locales fails when they drift.
{%- endcomment -%}
